{"4611110":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Beyond The Abandoned","steam_appid":4611110,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5065030],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond The Abandoned is a surreal third-person vertical platformer where you climb through the shifting realms of your mind, confronting hazards, enemies, and risky decisions on your ascent to regain consciousness. Explore over a dozen unique realms in one seamless map, from lava pits to lunar ruins.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>No checkpoints. No safety nets. The entire challenge is reaching the top. Fall, learn, and climb again.<\/i><\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ascending Your Strange Mind<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb almost any object, slide down any slope, and slam onto any enemy beneath your feet as you journey toward your destination above. The mechanics are snappy and intuitive, great for building speed and momentum once you master the controls. You even have slow-motion and precision walking modes to assist with tighter, riskier sections. Just keep an eye on your climbing stamina and hazard gauge. <i>What could possibly go wrong?<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4611110\/extras\/04a23007705b6f3d46ee4d904149179e.poster.avif?t=1793682074\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4611110\/extras\/04a23007705b6f3d46ee4d904149179e.webm?t=1793682074\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4611110\/extras\/04a23007705b6f3d46ee4d904149179e.mp4?t=1793682074\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Abandoned<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your adventure begins surrounded by a moat of lava and a surface of hissing fumaroles, standing alone in the center of a dark, burning world of charred remains and creatures eager to see you fall to your doom. On your climb to escape the Abandoned, patrolling demons stalk the paths and hidden bats wait in the dark, ready to send you down to where your journey began. Loose rocky platforms crumble under your feet, and a towering slope of falling boulders turns every upward step into a gamble.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4611110\/extras\/ebbd2019f3c22e8591a74f9e5963abc3.poster.avif?t=1793682074\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4611110\/extras\/ebbd2019f3c22e8591a74f9e5963abc3.webm?t=1793682074\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4611110\/extras\/ebbd2019f3c22e8591a74f9e5963abc3.mp4?t=1793682074\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies &amp; Hazards<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every environment has unique enemies and hazards. Sometimes the mind becomes unstable, causing platforms to collapse beneath your feet or the winds of the snowy mountains to blow you away. Demons, bats, bumblebees, sharks, birds, drones, spiders, and yes, even fluffy marshmallow creatures are ready to knock you off your climb in their own ways.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prize Machines<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many unlockables are scattered throughout the dreamlike world of Beyond The Abandoned to assist you on your climb. Collect coins and spend them at prize machine locations to unlock trampolines, bridges, and other forms of unexpected transportation. Also, keep your eyes and ears tuned to the whispers of the rare golden skull collectibles around the world!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Journey Beyond<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Abandoned is just the introduction to a vast and varied world above. Escape the burning skies that hold you down and discover a world filled with the beauty of life, to the void of nothingness, and everything in between. Push through the forest of fractured trees, ascend the abandoned city of skyscrapers ruled by flying drones, brave the windy, snow-covered peaks, and cross into surreal realms as you climb above the clouds and beyond.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4611110\/extras\/1c14040a5cd2d0995c206e4a7353cbe1.poster.avif?t=1793682074\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4611110\/extras\/1c14040a5cd2d0995c206e4a7353cbe1.webm?t=1793682074\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4611110\/extras\/1c14040a5cd2d0995c206e4a7353cbe1.mp4?t=1793682074\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Outfit for Every Occasion<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mind fills in the blanks, automatically adjusting your attire to match each new environment. Every outfit is tailored to the biome you’re in, giving you exactly what you need for the climb ahead.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Last Minute Advice<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1)<strong> <\/strong>Collect coins along the way, and it will make your next attempt slightly smoother.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2) The fountain of chances has no mercy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3) Don’t fall. Have fun!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb almost any object with fast, momentum-based movement.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide, slam, and vault your way through surreal environments.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage climbing stamina, hazards, and environmental instability.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock trampolines, bridges, and unexpected ways to travel via prize machines.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter demons, bats, bees, birds, drones, sharks, spiders, and even marshmallow creatures.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore over a dozen unique realms in one seamless map, from lava pits to lunar ruins.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond The Abandoned is a surreal third-person vertical platformer where you climb through the shifting realms of your mind, confronting hazards, enemies, and risky decisions on your ascent to regain consciousness. Explore over a dozen unique realms in one seamless map, from lava pits to lunar ruins.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>No checkpoints. No safety nets. The entire challenge is reaching the top. Fall, learn, and climb again.<\/i><\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ascending Your Strange Mind<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb almost any object, slide down any slope, and slam onto any enemy beneath your feet as you journey toward your destination above. The mechanics are snappy and intuitive, great for building speed and momentum once you master the controls. You even have slow-motion and precision walking modes to assist with tighter, riskier sections. Just keep an eye on your climbing stamina and hazard gauge. <i>What could possibly go wrong?<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4611110\/extras\/04a23007705b6f3d46ee4d904149179e.poster.avif?t=1793682074\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4611110\/extras\/04a23007705b6f3d46ee4d904149179e.webm?t=1793682074\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4611110\/extras\/04a23007705b6f3d46ee4d904149179e.mp4?t=1793682074\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Abandoned<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your adventure begins surrounded by a moat of lava and a surface of hissing fumaroles, standing alone in the center of a dark, burning world of charred remains and creatures eager to see you fall to your doom. On your climb to escape the Abandoned, patrolling demons stalk the paths and hidden bats wait in the dark, ready to send you down to where your journey began. Loose rocky platforms crumble under your feet, and a towering slope of falling boulders turns every upward step into a gamble.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4611110\/extras\/ebbd2019f3c22e8591a74f9e5963abc3.poster.avif?t=1793682074\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4611110\/extras\/ebbd2019f3c22e8591a74f9e5963abc3.webm?t=1793682074\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4611110\/extras\/ebbd2019f3c22e8591a74f9e5963abc3.mp4?t=1793682074\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies &amp; Hazards<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every environment has unique enemies and hazards. Sometimes the mind becomes unstable, causing platforms to collapse beneath your feet or the winds of the snowy mountains to blow you away. Demons, bats, bumblebees, sharks, birds, drones, spiders, and yes, even fluffy marshmallow creatures are ready to knock you off your climb in their own ways.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prize Machines<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many unlockables are scattered throughout the dreamlike world of Beyond The Abandoned to assist you on your climb. Collect coins and spend them at prize machine locations to unlock trampolines, bridges, and other forms of unexpected transportation. Also, keep your eyes and ears tuned to the whispers of the rare golden skull collectibles around the world!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Journey Beyond<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Abandoned is just the introduction to a vast and varied world above. Escape the burning skies that hold you down and discover a world filled with the beauty of life, to the void of nothingness, and everything in between. Push through the forest of fractured trees, ascend the abandoned city of skyscrapers ruled by flying drones, brave the windy, snow-covered peaks, and cross into surreal realms as you climb above the clouds and beyond.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4611110\/extras\/1c14040a5cd2d0995c206e4a7353cbe1.poster.avif?t=1793682074\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4611110\/extras\/1c14040a5cd2d0995c206e4a7353cbe1.webm?t=1793682074\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4611110\/extras\/1c14040a5cd2d0995c206e4a7353cbe1.mp4?t=1793682074\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Outfit for Every Occasion<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mind fills in the blanks, automatically adjusting your attire to match each new environment. Every outfit is tailored to the biome you’re in, giving you exactly what you need for the climb ahead.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Last Minute Advice<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1)<strong> <\/strong>Collect coins along the way, and it will make your next attempt slightly smoother.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2) The fountain of chances has no mercy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3) Don’t fall. Have fun!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb almost any object with fast, momentum-based movement.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide, slam, and vault your way through surreal environments.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage climbing stamina, hazards, and environmental instability.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock trampolines, bridges, and unexpected ways to travel via prize machines.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter demons, bats, bees, birds, drones, sharks, spiders, and even marshmallow creatures.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore over a dozen unique realms in one seamless map, from lava pits to lunar ruins.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Climb through the shifting realms of your mind, confronting hazards, enemies, and risky decisions on your ascent to regain consciousness.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4611110\/76588cd84db8e1de11da96509da7f978dce408a6\/header.jpg?t=1793682074","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4611110\/144d60bbdd08ad34d6a22